# The site is static (web/) plus functions in api/: waitlist.js (Node) and
# read.py (Python, which needs engine/ and requirements.txt).
# Paths are anchored with a leading slash so they match only at the repo root:
# an unanchored "data/" also matched web/data/ and left the site without its data.
